 ולכל 
\begin_inset Formula
$0\neq a\in\MKinteger$
\end_inset
 מתקיים:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
ax\equiv ay\mod N\Longleftrightarrow x\equiv y\mod{\frac{N}{\gcd\left(a,N\right)}}
\]


